In this phase, the completed PocketSmart AI project is presented to the faculty, judges, or audience.

Demonstration Steps
Open the PocketSmart AI website.
Explain the purpose of the project.
Select a category, such as Home Decor.
Enter a budget, such as ₹50,000.
Select a priority such as Balanced Value.
Click Get Recommendations.
Show the recommended items.
Explain the planned spending and remaining budget.
Change an item using the Swap this item option.
Show how the budget is recalculated.
Explain the money-saving tips.
Conclude by explaining how PocketSmart AI helps users make budget-based purchasing decisions.
